---
/** AI-assisted efficiency illustration for the result step. */
---

<div
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="relative max-w-xs min-w-xs text-left [--border:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-foreground)_7.5%,transparent)] [--primary:var(--color-indigo-500)]"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-6 top-6 z-[1]">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 scale-100 opacity-75 blur-lg transition-all duration-300 dark:opacity-50"
    >
      <div
        class="bg-linear-to-r/increasing animate-hue-rotate absolute inset-x-6 top-12 bottom-0 -translate-y-3 from-pink-400 to-purple-400"
      >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="bg-illustration/95 ring-border-illustration shadow-black/6.5 relative rounded-xl text-left shadow-lg ring-1 backdrop-blur"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="24"
        height="24"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="lucide lucide-x absolute top-2 right-2 size-3 text-muted-foreground"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M18 6 6 18"></path>
        <path d="m6 6 12 12"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="text-muted-foreground block p-3 text-xs">Wat pakken we eerst aan?</span>
      <div class="flex justify-between border-t p-2">
        <span
          class="hover:bg-foreground/5 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md p-2 duration-100"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="lucide lucide-brain size-3.5 text-fuchsia-600 opacity-90"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"
            ></path>
            <path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"
            ></path>
            <path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-xs">AI Agent</span>
        </span>
        <div
          class="brand-on-primary bg-primary before:border-foreground/20 relative flex size-6 rounded-md text-white shadow before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-md before:border"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="lucide lucide-corner-down-left m-auto size-3.5 drop-shadow"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <polyline points="9 10 4 15 9 20"></polyline>
            <path d="M20 4v7a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mask-b-from-25% mask-b-to-85% space-y-3 text-left text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <div class="text-muted-foreground">
      Leads krijgen nu met
      <span
        class="result-highlight bg-linear-to-r from-primary to-emerald-500 bg-clip-text px-0.5 text-transparent"
      >
        directe opvolging
      </span>
      binnen een uur antwoord.
    </div>
    <div class="text-muted-foreground">
      Niets glipt meer weg tussen mail, telefoon en je dagelijkse agenda.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .result-highlight {
    display: inline;
    position: relative;
    top: 0.035em;
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }
</style>
